nt_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1624070854,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100081501,"comment_content":"学习了","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":298327,"user_name":"进化菌","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1276861,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B30A5F78BB4171","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/13/7b/bd/ccb37425.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1624017285,"is_pvip":true,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":1,"score":6,"product_id":100081501,"comment_content":"结果导向型，以考试为目标，着重学习相关知识点，这样可能更有效吧。\n我记得我们以前临近考试，自习室爆满，大家挑灯夜读，终于还是能考过去。短期的突破，记忆会好很多，而且有人指出了重点，那自然不难~","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":298221,"user_name":"Geek_bce380","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1898000,"ip_address":"","ucode":"7A44AFF3FE98B9","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/f6/10/ba5663ca.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1623968469,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":6,"product_id":100081501,"comment_content":"今天给我更多的启发是，感觉就是对考试的结构有一个了解，大概的了解，然后和现在已经学到的知识拟合上去，思考出题者想要了解的知识点，而不是单纯的学习，学习是一个可以有树状结构的东西，而考试是一种串珠链线。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":298212,"user_name":"天然","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1097384,"ip_address":"","ucode":"B8B92656BC1FBE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/be/a8/2a8da07a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1623961465,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":1,"score":6,"product_id":100081501,"comment_content":"先确定问题，再去探索答案，探索的过程就是学习的过程，也是建立问题和答案之间的连接的过程。探索越是困难，连接越是牢固。","like_count":0}]}